      "title": "Filter sheet on a phone \u2014 390 \u00d7 844",
      "caption": "A phone reaches the same directories through the filter sheet. Before, a type earned a road there only once an item of it existed. After, an installed type has its road from the moment it is installed, matching the rail.",
